# Streaming resolution sync

How the web app matches the Kit renderer resolution to the browser viewport, and the constraints involved.

## Architecture overview

```
Browser viewport (e.g. 375×812)
  → getAlignedResolution() → encoder-safe dims (e.g. 384×816)
  → AppStream connect at 384×816
  → NVST encoder max set to 384×816
  → omni.kit.livestream.app resizeAppWindow → Kit renderer resizes to 384×816
  → dynamicResize adapts from Kit default (640×360) during transition
```

